repository-code: "https://github.com/nickharris808/cert-atlas"
url: "https://github.com/nickharris808/certified-oss"
abstract: >-
  A labelled corpus of valid and forged proof-carrying artifacts, and a two-sided metric for scoring any verifier.
  Part of certified-oss, built on one position: a recorded verdict is a claim to
  be checked, never an input to be trusted.
